# Trae behavior rules - preserve Stitch designs exactly

## Never
1. Do not modify any element's className list
2. Do not modify any element's style attribute
3. Do not modify the DOM structure
4. Do not modify SVG contents
5. Do not "optimize" Tailwind classes
6. Do not replace arbitrary values with theme tokens
7. Do not rename CSS variables
8. Do not replace existing Stitch controls with shadcn/ui

## Allowed and encouraged
1. Extract repeated JSX into child components without changing className
2. Replace hardcoded data with props or hook data
3. Add onClick / onChange / onSubmit handlers
4. Replace <a href> with Next.js <Link>
5. Replace <img src> with next/image while keeping className
6. Replace mock data with react-query useQuery
7. Integrate Zustand store without affecting styles

## Visual acceptance rule
After each page change, explicitly state:
"I did not modify any className or style, only [specific change]"

## Source of truth
_stitch-source/ is the immutable source of truth.
Any visual disagreement must be resolved against the .html files in that directory.
